    "never fetched.",
    "",
    "usesNote is optional and is a warning, not a description. Write one only when",
    "the species itself is dangerous, keep it to one short sentence, and say what it",
    "does to a person — never what it is mistaken for. This is a dex, not a foraging",
    "guide; a look-alike key belongs in a field guide and reads as noise here.",
    "",
    "The build enforces the rest: a fungus carries uses: [] and no Duke's fields",
    "(M35), and no text on a fungal record may use an edibility word, so the app",
    "never calls a mushroom edible, safe or choice — not even a chanterelle.",
    "",
    "'wikipediaTitle' pins the article; 'overrides' pins any output field except the",
    "use fields, which are refused."
